  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IFC and Excelerate Energy Bangladesh Limited (Excelerate) are co-developing the Moheshkhali Floating LNG project &#x2013; Bangladesh&#x2019;s first liquefied natural gas (LNG) import terminal. The project will be located offshore Moheshkhali Island in the Bay of Bengal and is expected to cost $179.5 million.</narrative>
  </description>
