   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project finance loan to Bangla Offshore is part of an IFC-led lending syndicate comprising the IFC, Japan&#xED;s JICA, Dutch development bank FMO, and Germany&#xED;s DEG. The project sponsors include IFC and Excelerate Energy, a Houston-based specialist in Floating Storage Regasification Unit (FSRU) projects.Our loan will support the development of clean energy in Bangladesh and help secure its future energy supply.</narrative>
   </description>
